OL,3,GNEWSAWartime radio hub linked to
OL,4,Asinking of German battleship up for
OL,5,Asale
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of Britain's key wartime radio
OL,8,Fstations is up for sale for nearly half
OL,9,Fa million pounds.
OL,11,FCriggion Radio Station in Powys was
OL,12,Fused not only to transmit messages to
OL,13,Fwarships and submarines during World
OL,14,FWar Two and the Cold War, but to
OL,15,Fconnect Britain to the world before
OL,16,Fsatellite communication.
OL,18,FPart of the station, named Shortwave A,
OL,19,Fis now on the market for #495,000 -
OL,20,Fthough neither the original radio
OL,21,Fequipment nor the station's distinctive
OL,22,F600ft (182.9m) towers remain.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
